  "title": "Bacon, Egg, and Cheese-Stuffed Loaf",
  "description": "A hollowed-out baguette is stuffed with eggs, bacon, sun-dried tomatoes, and fontina cheese in this easy recipe great for game day brunches.",
  "authors": [
    "Jill Lightner"
  ],
  "date_published": "2020-06-19T00:19:17-04:00",
